msgid "Holybro H-RTK F9P GNSS"
msgstr "Holybro H-RTK F9P GNSS"

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-rtk-f9p.rst:11
#: 1aec0ee9acf34013aea1139b92f8ba07 423a692d959341cba8b8acd600aac02a
#: 66606419b7924dedb3249aae95e5a3a8 be520edc74f34afba865320692585702
#: e36489c17d7a477b9f875a10c416afc2
msgid ""
"The `Holybro H-RTK F9P GNSS <http://www.holybro.com/product/h-rtk-f9p/>`_ is"
" an multi-band high-precision RTK GPS series by Holybro. This system "
"provides multi-band RTK with fast convergence times and reliable "
"performance, concurrent reception of GPS, GLONASS, Galileo and BeiDou, and "
"fast update rate for highly dynamic and high volume applications with "
"centimeter-accuracy. It uses a UBLOX F9P module, an IST8310 compass, and a "
"tri-colored NTF LED indicator. It also has a integrated safety switch for "
"simple and convenient operation."
msgstr ""
"`Holybro H-RTK F9P GNSS <http://www.holybro.com/product/h-rtk-f9p/>`_ 是 "
"Holybro 推出的多频段高精度 RTK GPS 系列产品。该系统提供多频段 RTK，具备快速收敛时间和可靠性能，可同时接收 "
"GPS、GLONASS、Galileo 和北斗信号，适用于对精度要求极高的高动态、大量应用，定位精度可达厘米级。它使用 UBLOX F9P "
"模块、IST8310 罗盘和三色 NTF LED 指示灯，并集成了安全开关，操作简便。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-rtk-f9p.rst:13
#: 134be9ee8cc44f35a7cab624a1429f4f 30b5903a1bee41b4bf0403a0666f0849
#: 3c22c299e97f4ce2bb70019bb02bbd40 8bf277f7c9264befaaf11992f11cc66e
#: c9793aa0e83a42719a491ac21d950690
msgid ""
"Using RTK allows ArduPilot to get its position with centimeter-level "
"accuracy, which is much more accurate than can be provided by a normal GPS."
msgstr "使用 RTK 可使 ArduPilot 获得厘米级定位精度，远优于普通 GPS 所能提供的精度。"

