#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-rtk-f9p.rst:35
#: 0efdd0372d884784aa5215713916b225 3b87bb2983b342c492f5492e4631c64d
#: 4d46bd56f85f425e9f418fd515eee9ea 63e2704b8be04543b706dd72e5bc0e97
#: 6882cd3ac28541d59257a3b48fee7f45
msgid ""
"For Pixhawk Cube 2.1 variant that does not come with a 10-way GPS port and "
"hence requires connector re-termination, note that the RX port on the GPS "
"module should feed into the port labelled GPS_RX (TX of autopilot board) on "
"the autopilot board. Also, the GPS1 port is 8-way only, which can be "
"circumvented by leaving 3v3 and buzzer lines out."
msgstr ""
"对于不带 10 针 GPS 端口的 Pixhawk Cube 2.1 变体，需要重新端接连接器。注意 GPS 模块上的 RX 端口应连接到飞控板上标有 "
"GPS_RX（飞控 TX）的端口。此外，GPS1 端口仅为 8 针，可通过省略 3.3V 和蜂鸣器线来解决。"

